    Bug 2045949 - Show a tooltip in the read/new indicator on cards view. r=tobyp,freaktechnik

    - Use the layout in cards view.
    - A message that is newly received should have a "New" tooltip when hovering over the star icon.
    - The aria-label of the cards element should communicate the new status.
    - A message that is unread should have an "unread" tooltip when hovering over the green bubble icon.
    - A read message should have the icon hidden, not just transparent, and no tooltip should be visible.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315446

